data: {"id": "22fd3df3ade543d5-thinking-parallel_evidence-1603", "run_id": "22fd3df3ade543d5", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已有证据，我来总结当前已采集的事实、冲突和缺口：\n\n## 已确认事实\n\n**1. Pod 状态：CrashLoopBackOff**\n- Pod YAML 确认：phase=Running，但 Ready=False，原因 `ContainersNotReady`，容器 app 状态为 `CrashLoopBackOff`，exitCode=137，restarts=15\n- ExitCode 137 是 Linux SIGKILL (9) 的标准返回值，最常见原因是 OOMKilled\n\n**2. Events 确认 OOMKill**\n- kubectl_events 返回关键行：`Warning BackOff Pod/workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h Back-off restarting failed container app`（241次 over 65分钟）\n- 这证实容器持续崩溃重启\n\n**3. 内存限制：64 MiB**\n- Prometheus 指标 `kube_pod_container_resource_limits` 确认 contain", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1788453440110, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

